@water 0
@lectern {"cell":[1,2,1],"text":"River crossing\n\nYou start on a floating lily pad. The water stream carries the pad and its riders toward the far dock. Step right onto the dock when you arrive.\n\nHeroes can board a floating pad from shore. Other units can stand on pads, and a blocked rider stops the whole platform.\n\nUse <!Undo!> to rewind a ride, or restart to float across again."}
